# XIV Engineering

## Workflow
`branch -> code -> test -> evidence -> review -> handoff`

- Child branch off authorized tip (`xiv-v2` unless handoff says otherwise).
- Fix one root cause at a time.
- Record evidence in `docs/operations/XIV_TEST_EVIDENCE.md`.
- Return the AGENTS.md receipt block on every task.

## Stack (prototype)
- Mobile: Expo / React Native under `apps/mobile`
- AI service: Node/TS under `services/ai` (port 8787)
- DB: Supabase / Postgres (+ local migrations under `supabase/`)
- Empty shells today: `apps/web`, `services/api`, `packages/*` — do not pretend they are implemented

## Tests
- Prefer existing scripts in `services/ai` (`test:runtime`, etc.) and mobile tests when present.
- Never claim tests passed that were not run.
- Skipped mandatory tests are not passes.

## Hardware (founder ASUS)
- AMD Ryzen 7 260 + Radeon 780M, ~32GB RAM, no NVIDIA CUDA.
- Local inference: Ollama first, DirectML/ONNX later, CPU fallback.
